%% Publishing a post, as a Mermaid sequence diagram. It plays as a dynamic view:
%% participants are matched to the flowchart's nodes by name.
sequenceDiagram
  title Publishing a post
  actor writer as Writer
  participant editor as Editor
  participant gateway as API Gateway
  participant posts as Posts service

  writer->>editor: Hit publish
  editor->>+gateway: POST /posts
  gateway->>+posts: Publish draft
  posts->>db: Save post
  posts-->>-gateway: 201 Created
  gateway-->>-editor: Post URL
  par Tell everyone
    posts-)bus: PostPublished
  and
    editor-)writer: Published!
  end
  bus-)search: Reindex
  bus-)mailer: New post
  mailer-)reader: Newsletter
